### 5. Adapter View Holder Implementation

**QueueRecyclerAdapter.java** (`/Volumes/Dumpy/Research/automated_program_repair_for_ui_bugs/runs/claude_original_run1/bug-1130/app/src/main/java/de/danoeh/antennapod/adapter/QueueRecyclerAdapter.java`)

ViewHolder class (Lines 117-203):
- Implements ItemTouchHelperViewHolder interface
- onItemSelected(): Sets alpha to 0.5f for visual feedback
- onItemClear(): Restores alpha to 1.0f

**AllEpisodesRecycleAdapter.java** (`/Volumes/Dumpy/Research/automated_program_repair_for_ui_bugs/runs/claude_original_run1/bug-1130/app/src/main/java/de/danoeh/antennapod/adapter/AllEpisodesRecycleAdapter.java`)

Holder class (Lines 232-302):
- Implements ItemTouchHelperViewHolder interface
- onItemSelected(): Sets itemView alpha to 0.5f
- onItemClear(): Sets itemView alpha to 1.0f

---

### 6. Layout Files

**queue_fragment.xml** (`/Volumes/Dumpy/Research/automated_program_repair_for_ui_bugs/runs/claude_original_run1/bug-1130/app/src/main/res/layout/queue_fragment.xml`):
- Contains RecyclerView (id=recyclerView)
- Contains empty TextView (id=@id/android:empty) with text="@string/no_items_label"
- Contains ProgressBar (id=progLoading)

**all_episodes_fragment.xml** (`/Volumes/Dumpy/Research/automated_program_repair_for_ui_bugs/runs/claude_original_run1/bug-1130/app/src/main/res/layout/all_episodes_fragment.xml`):
- Contains RecyclerView (id=@android:id/list)
- Contains ProgressBar (id=progLoading)
- **Note:** No explicit empty view defined in XML; AllEpisodesFragment does not show an empty view message

---

### Key Architectural Patterns

1. **No Dedicated EmptyViewHandler:** Empty view visibility is managed directly in fragments by checking data size
2. **Swipe Pattern:** All fragments use ItemTouchHelper.SimpleCallback with custom onSwiped() callbacks
3. **Visual Feedback:** ItemTouchHelperViewHolder interface manages alpha transparency during swipe
4. **Undo Mechanism:** Snackbar.setAction() executes corresponding DBWriter methods (add/remove/mark)
5. **Data Cleanup:** Subscriptions are unsubscribed before DB operations to prevent race conditions
6. **Delayed Actions:** AllEpisodesFragment uses Handler.postDelayed() for auto-delete after snackbar timeout

