// swiped away. ItemTouchHelper only resets the swipe state (translationX/alpha) of
// that view once it is detached from the RecyclerView, so hiding the list would leave
// the view holder translated off screen. Pressing "Undo" then re-used that very view
// holder and the restored item was invisible (see "Undo with last list item does not
// work"). The empty view is drawn on top of the (then empty) list instead.
